WEBVTT

00:00:03,700 --> 00:00:08,700
We were kind of thrust in the limelight a year and a half ago or so.

00:00:08,700 --> 00:00:13,700
We were taking care of this little eight-year-old girl with megaloblastoma, that's a brain cancer.

00:00:13,700 --> 00:00:21,700
And the parents just questioned the use of continued chemotherapy after she didn't have surgery to remove it.

00:00:21,700 --> 00:00:23,700
Then they came to me and said, we don't want to do any chemo.

00:00:23,700 --> 00:00:27,700
And I said, well, we're going to do our whole program, started on our whole program.

00:00:27,700 --> 00:00:32,700
And then the parents said, well, I don't know if we want to do any more chemo

00:00:32,700 --> 00:00:38,700
that oncologists said you need to do all this other chemo, and we need to do full spine, full brain radiation.

00:00:38,700 --> 00:00:41,700
And the parents just said, I don't know if we want to do this.

00:00:41,700 --> 00:00:46,700
When they got home, there was a sheriff at the door with child protective agency.

00:00:46,700 --> 00:00:50,700
People don't realize it, but your children are not your children in the United States.

00:00:50,700 --> 00:00:55,700
There is not a state in the United States that can't do the exact same thing to you.

00:00:55,700 --> 00:01:01,700
Once you're in the system, if you don't follow this quote-unquote standard protocol,

00:01:01,700 --> 00:01:05,700
you are in hot water, you are declared an unfit parent.

00:01:05,700 --> 00:01:09,700
They threaten that not only will that child be taken away and put it a foster care

00:01:09,700 --> 00:01:15,700
and be forced to do the chemo radiation without you present, but also her older sister will be taken away

00:01:15,700 --> 00:01:19,700
because you're going to be declared unfit parents.

00:01:19,700 --> 00:01:25,700
So the mother ended up going, do the chemo, do the radiation, though we pushed her down to Chicago

00:01:25,700 --> 00:01:28,700
where they had a unit that used a little bit less radiation.

00:01:28,700 --> 00:01:34,700
We negotiated that, but our local news station, Carol Levin, came up and did a little bit on her,

00:01:34,700 --> 00:01:40,700
and interviewed me because I was helping her, and then the state medical board came down right after.

00:01:40,700 --> 00:01:46,700
So they don't like me, so they still don't like me.

00:01:46,700 --> 00:01:48,700
We still get letters from that.

